# =============================================================================
# PROJECT HEDGE — NATS user credentials TEMPLATE for account: obs_collector
#
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL JWTs OR NKEY SEEDS. This file ships as a placeholder so
# the docker-compose volume mounts resolve. To mint real credentials run:
#
#   docker/nats/provision-creds.sh
#
# Account permissions enforced by `docker/nats/nats-server.conf`:
#   publish    : (none — denied on `>`, read-only collector)
#   subscribe  : >
#
# This credential is consumed by Prometheus exporters, the Loki log shipper,
# and the Jaeger collector. It is read-only by design so a compromised
# collector cannot inject events onto the bus.
# =============================================================================

-----BEGIN NATS USER JWT-----
